### In his own words  *(clearly attributed block — see note)*

These are claims the run could not corroborate from any source outside his own
materials. He confirmed they are his and are real, and asked that they appear. Under
`§5` they ship as first-person speech, never as verified fact, with no logos, no
credential styling, and no metrics dressed up as measured outcomes.

> Alongside this I've worked as a semiconductor manufacturing specialist at Intel, and
> before that spent twelve years in robotics and automation at Cyborg Tech across more
> than twenty projects, including one that cut water use by 78% across seven
> greenhouses. I'm studying software engineering at St Cloud State, I interpret across
> five languages, and I'm about sixty thousand words into a book called *The Third
> Eye*.

**Open decision for Gate C:** this block is the weakest evidence on the site and the
easiest for a reader to check. It is here because he asked for it. Recommend he
either supplies one source per line, or cuts the lines he cannot source, before this
goes public. Presented to him at Gate C for that call.

